      "year": 1920,
      "event": "built",
      "note": "D-6 cupola cabin, per Willhite; an August 1920 Spokesman-Review story describes a standard lookout house finished on the summit. FFLOS dates the cabin only to the 1920s",
      "from": "research",
      "source_url": "https://washingtonlookouts.weebly.com/lookout-mountain5.html",
